field-artillery-not-deployed = The gun has to be wrenched down first.
field-artillery-no-gunner = Take the gunner's position to fire the gun.
field-artillery-too-close = Too close - the shell would land on the crew.
field-artillery-out-of-arc = The target is outside the gun's firing arc.
field-artillery-gunner-cannot-load = You can't load the gun from the gunner's position. Someone else has to feed it.
